  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': My Kind Of Scum / Fearless And Inventive, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace, Tatooine: Desert Heart, Prepared Defenses, Power Of The Hutt, Secret Plans, First Strike; these count toward the 60. Secret Plans is an Effect in 2001.",
  "Several Effects start (Power Of The Hutt, Secret Plans, First Strike); none is named as the starting Effect, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Dr. E and PB' dested Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba; 'Iggy in IG2000' dested IG-88 In IG-2000; 'Jabbas Floating Eatery (Sail Barge)' dested the vehicle Jabba's Sail Barge (posted under 'Blue').",
  "Posted 'Tat Jabbas Palace', 'JP Audience Chamber' and 'Tatooine System' dested the Dark pages Tatooine: Jabba's Palace, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark) and Tatooine (Dark) (Premiere).",
  "Posted '4-LOM with gun', 'Bossk with gun', 'Dengar with gun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle, Bossk With Mortar Gun, Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Omni Box & Its Worse' dested Ommni Box & It's Worse.",
  "The post's section headings 'Blue', 'Green' and 'Red' mean starships/vehicles, weapons and interrupts/effects.",
  "The deck title refers to Myo (the representative), not the card Monnok, per the post. The post's EDIT suggests swapping Bossk With Mortar Gun, Stinger and others for No Escape, Dengar in ship, another Myo and Death Mark; the list is kept as posted."
